          "caption": "Romsdal valley in Norway.  According to locals, this is the \"Søre Gravdehaug\", a small farm under the Søre Flatmark farm.  The houses are gone now. Living on the farm in the late 1800s were Thore and Ane/Anne Gravdehaug and their children. The fence is called \"stong-hafelle\". Source: Gamlebilder fra Rauma (Facebook interest group) and Bjørn Austigard: Røter",
